## Acceptance
pytest tests pass (python -m pytest conference/model_v2/tests/test_trans_intervention.py -q); report exact counts. Concise handoff (<=40 lines) written to conference/model_v2/ops/briefs/F1_RESULT.md: files, test counts, open questions, any invariant you could not satisfy. No prose discussion.
